== Overview ==
'''Jetpack Mutant Toilet''' is one of the final bosses of [[Toilet HQ]]. It is fast, strong, and can also stun units. He was the final boss of [[Toilet HQ]] replacing the [[Glitch Toilet]]. But then he was replaced and moved down to Wave 49 on the next update because of him getting replaced with a new final boss which is the [[Quad Rocket Mutant Toilet|Quad Rocket Mutant Toilet,]] then was moved down to Wave 48 because of the [[Scientist Toilet]] getting added.
== Appearance ==
He has 2 buzzsaws, a jetpack, a blindfold and 5 extra props on his toilet.
== Health ==

=== [[Nightmare Mode]] ===
Wave 48: 1,207,500 HP

=== [[Nightmare Mode]] (Old) ===
Wave 49: 1,228,500 HP

Wave 50: 1,250,000 HP

=== Other ===
Wave 1: 150,000 HP
== Strategy ==
*The Jetpack Mutant Toilet is an extremely high health enemy. So high DPS units are required to defeat this enemy.
*Jetpack Mutant Toilet is also quite fast, so you could use [[Upgraded Titan Cameraman]] Levels 5/6 to slow this enemy down. 
*You can also use [[TV Woman]] or [[Mech Cameraman|Mech Cameraman,]] but those units do not do as much DPS, so they are less recommended.
*Jetpack Mutant Toilet also will frequently stun units if it gets near any, so [[Camera Repair Drone]] or [[Medic Cameraman]] are required to unstun any units that have been stunned. 
*As Jetpack Mutant Toilet stuns units very fast, you will need more than one Medic Cameraman to unstun all units stunned. 
*[[Upgraded Titan Speakerman]] can absorb up to two stuns from the Jetpack Mutant Toilet, making  Camera Repair Drone and Medic Cameraman's job slightly easier.
*He doesn't one-shot your base as he only does 250 damage to your base.

== Trivia ==

* In one of Telanthric's videos, he spawned the Jetpack Mutant Toilet at Wave 1 and it had 150,000 HP.
* In the series, he has many cameramen/large cameramen bodies and a Large Speakerman head on the spikes on his toilet.
* This Toilet is based of the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Jetpack_Buzzsaw_Impaler_Skibidi_Toilet Jetpack Buzzsaw Impaler Skibidi Toilet.]

